### Task 1: Core API

# Create a completed deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-EXTERNAL",
  "toAccount": "ACC-ALICE",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit",
  "status": "completed"
}

###

# Create a pending transfer
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-ALICE",
  "toAccount": "ACC-BOB",
  "amount": 250.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "pending"
}

###

# Get all transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

###

# Get account balance (only completed counts)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-ALICE/balance

### Task 3: Filtering

# Filter by account and type
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-ALICE&type=transfer

### Task 4: Advanced Features

# Account Summary (matrix + latest date)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-ALICE/summary

###

# Interest calculation (5% for 30 days)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-ALICE/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

###

# Export to CSV
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/export?format=csv
